<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-12 col-sm-12 bg-area u-sa-navyBg" data-zesty-id="design:columns:3 Columns:16:15-1:3 Columns:1">
<h6 data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:12:51">Soup Kitchens</h6>

<p>
	A hot meal can make a world of difference to someone that is struggling with food insecurity or homelessness.&nbsp;
</p>
